# House: raises the POPULATION cap of the nearest built own-team barracks within "House link
# radius" ("House population" each; one barracks per house, re-derived every tick). No power, no
# grid role; just population that dies with it. A 4x3x4 m block (2x2 cells).
# Spawned origin 1.5 above the ground hit.
Prefab gameHouse
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.85 0.65 0.35
		Scale 2 1.5 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 1.5 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
